  When the selected blocks contain multiple non-contiguous segments, such as the documented `0,1,2,8,9`, `z` points to the space between blocks. Passing `z, z + 1` to `lettres` therefore finds no alphanumeric character and raises `IndexError`, so `pub.py` cannot create the advertisement.

